## Known Limitations

1. **FontStashSharp vs TextMeshPro**: Glyph rendering, kerning, and anti-aliasing will differ. This is unavoidable without a custom SDF font renderer.
2. **Auto-sizing**: TitleText and ComposerText use TMP auto-sizing (shrink-to-fit). We use the max font size as fixed — short text will match but long text won't auto-shrink.
